# Work Order Process

Read `AGENT_PROCESS.md` before implementing a Work Order.

- Work Orders live in `docs/work_orders/` unless this repo defines another path.
- Confirm recorded human acceptance, completed dependencies, and exclusive ownership.
- Stay inside `Problem`, `What To Build`, `Out Of Scope`, and `Do NOT Change`.
- Run the Work Order validation plan and project quality gate.
- Ask for human verification when required.
- File follow-ons for adjacent work instead of expanding the current change.
- Record evidence and required review results; reconcile declared status records.

